    "Description": "DBI is a database access Application Programming Interface (API) for the Perl Language. The DBI API Specification defines a set of functions, variables and conventions that provide a consistent database interface independent of the actual database being used.\n\nSecurity Fix(es):\n\n* DBI: DBI: Arbitrary code execution via caller-influenced Profile attribute (CVE-2026-14380)\n\n* DBI: DBI: Heap overflow when preparsing SQL statements with excessive placeholders (CVE-2026-14739)\n\nFor more details about the security issue(s), including the impact, a CVSS score, acknowledgments, and other related information, refer to the CVE page(s) listed in the References section.",
